## Scratch space
# Throwaway files (API probe payloads, curl bodies, sample responses) belong here.
scratch/
.scratch/
*.tmp
*.bak
*.orig
*.rej
*~

# Loose JSON at the repo root is almost always a scratch artifact -- real config
# lives under src/ or ops/. Ignore it by default and whitelist the exceptions,
# so a stray probe payload can never be committed by accident.
/*.json
!/global.json

